   {
    "what": "[ExcludeFromCodeCoverage] added to the user-declared partial resolver classes (C-2297-07)",
    "why": "It changes the consumer's public type metadata and breaks the build (CS0579) for users who already excluded their resolver by hand; public API and compatibility rule 1, owner decides."
   }
